            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DidIDoThat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was quite a surprise, and very pleasantly delicious. I did add rosemary all over it and stuffed the cavity with one of the 1/2 squeezed grapefruit and 1/2 an onion. Yum yum.",
            "datePublished": "2026-04-09T16:50:43.529Z"
